{"ref":"BDB, צַ֫יִד","hw":"צַ֫יִד","html":"† I. <big><span dir=\"rtl\">צַ֫יִד</span></big>  <strong>n.m. hunting, game</strong>;—abs. <span dir=\"rtl\">צ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 10:9\" href=\"/Genesis.10.9\">Gn 10:9</a> +, <span dir=\"rtl\">צָ֑יִד</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:3\" href=\"/Genesis.27.3\">27:3</a> (Qr; > Kt <span dir=\"rtl\">צידה</span>), <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 13:15\" href=\"/Nehemiah.13.15\">Ne 13:15</a>, cstr. <span dir=\"rtl\">צֵיד</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:25\" href=\"/Genesis.27.25\">Gn 27:25</a>; sf. <span dir=\"rtl\">צֵידִי</span> v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:19\" href=\"/Genesis.27.19\">19</a>, etc.;—<br><strong>1.</strong>  <em>hunting</em> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:30\" href=\"/Genesis.27.30\">Gn 27:30</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">גִּבֹּר־צ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 10:9\" href=\"/Genesis.10.9\">10:9</a><sup>(×2)</sup>, <span dir=\"rtl\">יֹדֵעַ צ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:27\" href=\"/Genesis.25.27\">25:27</a> (all J).<br><strong>2.</strong>  <em>game</em> hunted and taken (cf. Ba<sup>NB 161</sup>), <a data-ref=\"Genesis 25:28\" href=\"/Genesis.25.28\">Gn 25:28</a>; <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:3\" href=\"/Genesis.27.3\">27:3</a> (v. supr.) v <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:5\" href=\"/Genesis.27.5\">5</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:7\" href=\"/Genesis.27.7\">7</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:19\" href=\"/Genesis.27.19\">19</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:25\" href=\"/Genesis.27.25\">25</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:31\" href=\"/Genesis.27.31\">31</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 27:33\" href=\"/Genesis.27.33\">33</a> (all J), cf. <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 12:27\" href=\"/Proverbs.12.27\">Pr 12:27</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">צֵיד חַיָּה אוֹ עוֹף</span> <a data-ref=\"Leviticus 17:13\" href=\"/Leviticus.17.13\">Lv 17:13</a> (H).","next":"BDB, צַיָּד","prev":"BDB, צוּד"}